  "titles": {
    "_tiers_note": "Fused Celtic-Iroquoian clanhold, ascending; titles blend the two (Celtic aire/toisech/flaith/ri + Iroquoian royaner/rotiskenrakehte/tadodaho). Aironer (clan-lord) barony; Maoresken (war-warden) march; Toisoner (sept-chief) county; Flaitoken (lord) duchy; Rinakenra (king-sachem) principality; Ruironon (over-chief) kingdom; Ardonaho (high-chief / grand firekeeper) empire. The clan-mothers seat and may depose the chiefs; the grove-council rules by consensus. (Rank titles fuse the real Gaelic/Iroquois register, allowed.)",
